    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, the tax law and the state finance law, in relation to providing for taxpayer gifts for lupus education and prevention, and establishing the lupus education and prevention fund and outreach program",
    "basePrintNo": "S553",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S553-2015",
